{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46807","headline":"酬蜀国欧阳学士 · 齐己","name":"酬蜀国欧阳学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因缘刘表驻经行，又听西风堕叶声。\n鹤发不堪言此世，峨嵋空约在他生。\n已从禅祖参真性，敢向诗家认好名。\n深愧故人怜潦倒，每传仙语下南荆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}